<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS3.SSSx1.Px3" title="In Slot Accuracy ‣ 6.3 Analysis of the results with referenceless metrics ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Slot Accuracy confirms the model behaviour</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS3.SSSx2.Px1" title="In Dialogue Act accuracy ‣ 6.3 Analysis of the results with referenceless metrics ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">High coherence with communicative intentions</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS3.SSSx2.Px2" title="In Dialogue Act accuracy ‣ 6.3 Analysis of the results with referenceless metrics ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Same model behaviour across all the metrics</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>Impact of the corpus characteristic on the results</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSSx2.Px1" title="In Influence of the number of references ‣ 6.4 Impact of the corpus characteristic on the results ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">No meaningful differences across metrics and representations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSSx2.Px2" title="In Influence of the number of references ‣ 6.4 Impact of the corpus characteristic on the results ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Higher impact in datasets with lexically and semantically different references</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSSx3.Px1" title="In Influence of the number of attributes ‣ 6.4 Impact of the corpus characteristic on the results ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Increasing impact of the meaning representation with the number of attributes</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSSx3.Px2" title="In Influence of the number of attributes ‣ 6.4 Impact of the corpus characteristic on the results ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Issue with artificial perfect scores</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS4.SSSx3.Px3" title="In Influence of the number of attributes ‣ 6.4 Impact of the corpus characteristic on the results ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Direct relation with Slot Accuracy results</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS5" title="In 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.5 </span>Qualitative analysis of the generations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS5.SSSx1.Px1" title="In Analysis of metric scores ‣ 6.5 Qualitative analysis of the generations ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">BLEU is not adequate for evaluation of output quality</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS5.SSSx1.Px2" title="In Analysis of metric scores ‣ 6.5 Qualitative analysis of the generations ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">BLEURT detects omissions and semantic nuances</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS5.SSSx2.Px1" title="In Analysis of the influence of Prompt representation for different datasets ‣ 6.5 Qualitative analysis of the generations ‣ 6 Results &amp; discussion ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Prompt representations produce omissions in ViGGO</span></a></li>
