</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_email"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Email: </span><a href="mailto:"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">alain.vazquez@ehu.eus</span></a>
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname"><a href="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1773-3214" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2603.29518v1/orcid.svg" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:9/9;" width="9" height="9"></object> Maria Inés Torres</a>
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Speech Interactive Group
</span>
