<section id="S3.SS0.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_subsubsection">ViGGO corpus<span id="footnote4" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">4</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note"><span id="footnote4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">4</span></span>
            
            
            
          <span id="footnote4.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">Available free on </span><a href="https://nlds.soe.ucsc.edu/viggo" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_medium">https://nlds.soe.ucsc.edu/viggo</a><span id="footnote4.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> </span></span></span></span></h4>

<div id="S3.SS0.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.SS0.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">ViGGO corpus <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Juraska et al., 2019</a>)</cite> is a dataset in the domain of video games collected with the same protocol as E2E. However, ViGGO contains more variability in terms of DA. Table <a href="#S3.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ ViGGO corpus 4 footnote 4 4 footnote 4 Available free on https://nlds.soe.ucsc.edu/viggo ‣ 3 Corpora ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> presents samples of three of the nine different communicative intentions: inform, give an opinion or ask about a preference for a specific video game characteristic. The attributes and values appear in multiple slot-value pair combinations in the MRs. The attributes are domain-specific, such as <span id="S3.SS0.SSSx2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">release_year</span> or <span id="S3.SS0.SSSx2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">esrb</span> in the samples of Table <a href="#S3.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ ViGGO corpus 4 footnote 4 4 footnote 4 Available free on https://nlds.soe.ucsc.edu/viggo ‣ 3 Corpora ‣ Impact of enriched meaning representations for language generation in dialogue tasks: A comprehensive exploration of the relevance of tasks, corpora and metrics." class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S3.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Samples of the ViGGO corpus</figcaption>
