<td id="S4.T6.12.1.4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left">Wildwood, a restaurant with a low customer rating, is near Café Rouge.</td></tr>
</table></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T6.12.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T6.12.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" rowspan="4"><span id="S4.T6.12.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ViGOO</span></td>
<td id="S4.T6.12.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T6.12.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input MR</span></td>
<td id="S4.T6.12.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">
