<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span>MultiWOZ (<span id="S6.F4.sf3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Slot Accuracy</span>)</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
