<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(d) </span>EMPATHIC (<span id="S6.F4.sf4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Slot Accuracy</span>)</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 4: </span>Distribution of the Slot Accuracy <span id="S6.F4.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MR scores</span> after fine-tuning for each representation in each dataset.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S6.F5" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<p id="S6.F5.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="S6.F5.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;">

</span>
<span id="S6.F5.2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_align_center ltx_inline-block" style="width:345.0pt;">
</span></p></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="S6.F5.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel"><img src="2603.29518v1/figures/slot_acc_e2e.png" id="S6.F5.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/394;" width="476" height="394" alt="Refer to caption">
