<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>ViGGO <span id="S6.F5.sf2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">(Slot Accuracy)</span></figcaption>
